---
// the components index: every component as a card, grouped by role.
import Section from '../../layouts/Section.astro';
import { url } from '../../data/site';
---
<Section section="components">
  <p slot="intro">
    Each component has a page that follows the same order: what it is for, with a live example; when to use it, and when
    to use something else; its parts; its kinds and states; how it behaves; accessibility; how to write its words; do and
    don't; related pages; and, at the end, its exact specs. A link at the top of each page leads to its
    <a href={url('react/')}>React implementation</a>. The brand's marks, the chevron and the lockup, are on
    <a href={url('styles/brand/')}>brand</a>, and the icons on <a href={url('styles/iconography/')}>iconography</a>.
  </p>
</Section>
